{"id": "58dd2ed9-3d49-47a6-982d-92163af8b51b", "slug": "mobile-job-app-flow", "title": "Mobile Job App Flow", "description": "Mobile Job Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Mobile Job App Flow\"\ndescription: \"Mobile Job Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FFCF54\"\n  secondary: \"#8E8E93\"\n  accent: \"#1DB954\"\n  background: \"#D19E15\"\n  surface: \"#8E8E93\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#8E8E93\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"ui-sans-serif\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"ui-sans-serif\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"40px\"\n  control: \"20px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Mobile Job App Flow\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 30; favorites: 10; remixes: 0.\nTags: hero, section, animated, threejs, cta, effect.\n## Overview\nMobile Job Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.\n\nHello, Sarah! Wish you good day. Recent Jobs View all SoundWave Product Designer Fulltime Remote Browse Category View all Recommended 264+ Job Nearby 231+ Job Recently Added 250+ Job Applied Jobs See your applied jobs h…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Hello, Sarah!; Recent Jobs; Product Designer; Category; Recommended; Nearby.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FFCF54, secondary #8E8E93, accent #1DB954, background #D19E15, surface #8E8E93, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse ui-sans-serif for display moments and ui-sans-serif for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Mobile Job App Flow</title>\n\n    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Iconify -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- GSAP & ScrollTrigger -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <style>\n        /* Hide scrollbars for cleaner mobile flow preview */\n        .no-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar {\n            display: none;\n        }\n        .no-scrollbar {\n            -ms-overflow-style: none;  /* IE and Edge */\n            scrollbar-width: none;  /* Firefox */\n        }\n\n        /* Custom Font Family (Fallback to Inter if not explicitly loaded, keeping it clean) */\n        body {\n            font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\n        }\n\n        /* Border Gradient Utilities */\n        .premium-border {\n            position: relative;\n            background: #242426;\n            border-radius: 32px;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n        .premium-border::before {\n            content: \"\";\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: -1px;\n            border-radius: 33px;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%);\n            z-index: -1;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#D19E15] min-h-screen flex items-center justify-start lg:justify-center p-4 lg:p-12 overflow-x-auto no-scrollbar\">\n\n    <!-- Container for the 3 screens -->\n    <div class=\"flex flex-row gap-8 items-start w-max mx-auto px-4 lg:px-0 pb-8 pt-8\">\n\n        <!-- SCREEN 1: Home -->\n        <main class=\"w-[390px] h-[844px] bg-[#1C1C1E] rounded-[40px] shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col shrink-0 border border-white/5\">\n\n            <!-- Content Area -->\n            <div class=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto no-scrollbar px-6 pt-12 pb-28\">\n\n                <!-- Header -->\n                <header class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-8\">\n                    <div>\n                        <h1 class=\"text-white text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight reveal-text leading-tight mb-1\">Hello,<br>Sarah!</h1>\n                        <p class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-xs font-normal\">Wish you good day.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                        <div class=\"relative\">\n                            <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/4f5668c5-fc4a-44e0-bc5e-a664189d3c31_1600w.jpg\" alt=\"Profile\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full object-cover border border-white/10\" style=\"object-position: center 20%;\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-red-500 border-2 border-[#1C1C1E] rounded-full\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </header>\n\n                <!-- Search -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-8\">\n                    <div class=\"flex-1 bg-[#28282B] rounded-[20px] px-5 py-4 flex items-center gap-3\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:magnifier-linear\" class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Search for job title\" class=\"bg-transparent border-none outline-none text-white text-sm w-full placeholder:text-[#8E8E93]\">\n                    </div>\n                    <button class=\"bg-[#28282B] w-[52px] h-[52px] rounded-[20px] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:tuning-square-2-linear\" class=\"text-[#FFCF54] text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Recent Jobs Section -->\n                <div class=\"mb-8\">\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end mb-4\">\n                        <h2 class=\"text-white text-base font-medium\">Recent Jobs</h2>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-xs font-medium\">View all</a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Main Card with Border Gradient -->\n                    <div class=\"premium-border p-6 flex flex-col items-center\">\n                        <div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-[#1DB954]/20 rounded-[20px] flex items-center justify-center mb-4\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:music-library-2-bold\" class=\"text-[#1DB954] text-3xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-xs mb-1\">SoundWave</p>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-white text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight mb-4\">Product Designer</h3>\n\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-2 mb-8\">\n                            <span class=\"bg-[#38383A] text-[#8E8E93] text-[11px] px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full font-medium\">Fulltime</span>\n                            <span class=\"bg-[#38383A] text-[#8E8E93] text-[11px] px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full font-medium\">Remote</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"flex w-full gap-3 items-center\">\n                            <button class=\"flex-1 bg-[#FFCF54] text-black font-medium text-sm py-4 rounded-[20px]\">Browse</button>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:menu-dots-vertical-linear\" class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-xl px-2\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <button class=\"w-[52px] h-[52px] bg-[#38383A] rounded-[20px] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bookmark-linear\" class=\"text-white text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Category Section -->\n                <div>\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end mb-4\">\n                        <h2 class=\"text-white text-base font-medium\">Category</h2>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-xs font-medium\">View all</a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-3\">\n                        <div class=\"col-span-2 bg-[#C8F69B] rounded-[24px] p-5 flex flex-col justify-center\">\n                            <h4 class=\"text-black text-sm font-medium mb-1\">Recommended</h4>\n                            <p class=\"text-black/60 text-[10px] font-medium\">264+ Job</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-span-1 bg-[#FF8E72] rounded-[24px] p-5 flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center row-span-2\">\n                            <h4 class=\"text-black text-sm font-medium mb-1 mt-auto\">Nearby</h4>\n                            <p class=\"text-black/60 text-[10px] font-medium mb-auto\">231+ Job</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-span-2 bg-[#FFB874] rounded-[24px] p-5 flex flex-col justify-center\">\n                            <h4 class=\"text-black text-sm font-medium mb-1\">Recently Added</h4>\n                            <p class=\"text-black/60 text-[10px] font-medium\">250+ Job</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Navigation -->\n            <nav class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-[90px] bg-[#1C1C1E] flex items-center justify-around px-6 z-10 pb-4\">\n                <button class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-[#FFCF54] rounded-[20px] flex items-center justify-center\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:home-2-bold\" class=\"text-black text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:case-linear\" class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bookmark-linear\" class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:user-linear\" class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n            </nav>\n        </main>\n\n        <!-- SCREEN 2: Applied Jobs -->\n        <main class=\"w-[390px] h-[844px] bg-[#1C1C1E] rounded-[40px] shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col shrink-0 border border-white/5\">\n\n            <div class=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto no-scrollbar px-6 pt-12 pb-28\">\n\n                <!-- Header -->\n                <header class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-8\">\n                    <div>\n                        <h1 class=\"text-white text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight reveal-text leading-tight mb-1\">Applied<br>Jobs</h1>\n                        <p class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-xs font-normal\">See your applied jobs here.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                        <div class=\"relative\">\n                            <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/4f5668c5-fc4a-44e0-bc5e-a664189d3c31_1600w.jpg\" alt=\"Profile\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full object-cover border border-white/10\" style=\"object-position: center 20%;\">\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </header>\n\n                <!-- Tabs -->\n                <div class=\"flex gap-3 mb-8 overflow-x-auto no-scrollbar py-1\">\n                    <button class=\"bg-[#FFCF54] text-black px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium whitespace-nowrap flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        All <span class=\"bg-black/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-md text-[10px]\">15</span>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"border border-[#38383A] text-[#8E8E93] px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium whitespace-nowrap flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        Applied <span class=\"bg-[#38383A] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-md text-[10px]\">5</span>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"border border-[#38383A] text-[#8E8E93] px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium whitespace-nowrap flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        Accepted <span class=\"bg-[#38383A] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-md text-[10px]\">10</span>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Job List -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\">\n\n                    <!-- Item 1: Accepted -->\n                    <div class=\"bg-[#242426] rounded-[28px] p-5\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-3\">\n                            <div class=\"flex gap-3 items-center\">\n                                <div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-[#1DB954]/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:music-library-2-bold\" class=\"text-[#1DB954] text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <p class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-[11px] mb-0.5\">SoundWave</p>\n                                    <h4 class=\"text-white text-sm font-medium\">Product Designer</h4>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bookmark-linear\" class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-2 mb-4 ml-[52px]\">\n                            <span class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-[10px] font-medium\">Fulltime</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-[10px] font-medium\">Remote</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center border-t border-[#38383A] pt-4 mt-2\">\n                            <div>\n                                <p class=\"text-white text-xs font-medium mb-1\">$2 - $5K/Month</p>\n                                <p class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-[10px] flex items-center gap-1\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:map-point-linear\"></iconify-icon> USA, Canada</p>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-[#4ADE80] text-xs font-medium\">Accepted</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Item 2: Rejected -->\n                    <div class=\"bg-[#242426] rounded-[28px] p-5\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-3\">\n                            <div class=\"flex gap-3 items-center\">\n                                <div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-[#E50914]/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-stream-bold\" class=\"text-[#E50914] text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <p class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-[11px] mb-0.5\">ViewFlex</p>\n                                    <h4 class=\"text-white text-sm font-medium\">Copy Writer</h4>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bookmark-bold\" class=\"text-[#4ADE80] text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-2 mb-4 ml-[52px]\">\n                            <span class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-[10px] font-medium\">Fulltime</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-[10px] font-medium\">Remote</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-[10px] font-medium\">Anywhere</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center border-t border-[#38383A] pt-4 mt-2\">\n                            <div>\n                                <p class=\"text-white text-xs font-medium mb-1\">$3 - $6K/Month</p>\n                                <p class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-[10px] flex items-center gap-1\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:map-point-linear\"></iconify-icon> UK, London</p>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-[#F87171] text-xs font-medium\">Rejected</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Item 3: Neutral -->\n                    <div class=\"bg-[#242426] rounded-[28px] p-5\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-3\">\n                            <div class=\"flex gap-3 items-center\">\n                                <div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-[#171A21]/50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:gamepad-bold\" class=\"text-[#66C0F4] text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <p class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-[11px] mb-0.5\">PlayCore</p>\n                                    <h4 class=\"text-white text-sm font-medium\">Game Developer</h4>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bookmark-linear\" class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-2 mb-4 ml-[52px]\">\n                            <span class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-[10px] font-medium\">Contract</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-[10px] font-medium\">On-site</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Navigation -->\n            <nav class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-[90px] bg-[#1C1C1E] flex items-center justify-around px-6 z-10 pb-4\">\n                <button class=\"w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:home-2-linear\" class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-[#FFCF54] rounded-[20px] flex items-center justify-center\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:case-bold\" class=\"text-black text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:map-point-search-linear\" class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:user-linear\" class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n            </nav>\n        </main>\n\n        <!-- SCREEN 3: Job Detail -->\n        <main class=\"w-[390px] h-[844px] bg-[#1C1C1E] rounded-[40px] shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col shrink-0 border border-white/5\">\n\n            <div class=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto no-scrollbar px-6 pt-12 pb-32\">\n\n                <!-- Header Nav -->\n                <header class=\"flex justify-between items-center mb-8\">\n                    <button class=\"w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-start\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-left-linear\" class=\"text-white text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-white text-base font-medium\">Job Detail</h2>\n                    <button class=\"w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-end\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bookmark-linear\" class=\"text-white text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                </header>\n\n                <!-- Hero Section -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center mb-10\">\n                    <div class=\"w-20 h-20 bg-[#1DB954]/20 rounded-[24px] flex items-center justify-center mb-5\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:music-library-2-bold\" class=\"text-[#1DB954] text-4xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-sm mb-1\">SoundWave</p>\n                    <h1 class=\"text-white text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight reveal-text mb-4 text-center\">Product Designer</h1>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex gap-2\">\n                        <span class=\"bg-[#38383A] text-[#8E8E93] text-xs px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full font-medium\">Fulltime</span>\n                        <span class=\"bg-[#38383A] text-[#8E8E93] text-xs px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full font-medium\">Remote</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Info Grid -->\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-4 gap-2 mb-10\">\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center\">\n                        <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-[#38383A] flex items-center justify-center mb-3\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:user-rounded-linear\" class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-[10px] mb-1\">Position</p>\n                        <p class=\"text-white text-[11px] font-medium\">Senior</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center\">\n                        <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-[#38383A] flex items-center justify-center mb-3\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:case-linear\" class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-[10px] mb-1\">Job Type</p>\n                        <p class=\"text-white text-[11px] font-medium\">Remote</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center\">\n                        <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-[#38383A] flex items-center justify-center mb-3\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:wallet-linear\" class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-[10px] mb-1\">Salary</p>\n                        <p class=\"text-white text-[11px] font-medium\">$2k - $5k</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center\">\n                        <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-[#38383A] flex items-center justify-center mb-3\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:map-point-linear\" class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-[10px] mb-1\">Location</p>\n                        <p class=\"text-white text-[11px] font-medium\">Canada</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Content Tabs -->\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center mb-6 px-2\">\n                    <button class=\"text-[#FFCF54] text-sm font-medium border-b-2 border-[#FFCF54] pb-2\">Description</button>\n                    <button class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-sm font-medium pb-2\">Company</button>\n                    <button class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-sm font-medium pb-2\">Requirements</button>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Description Text -->\n                <div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-white text-base font-medium mb-3\">About The opportunity</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-[#8E8E93] text-sm leading-relaxed font-normal\">\n                        One has to dig into the past to know how a small start-up is making millions now. SoundWave made its humble beginning in Stockholm, Sweden, with a name that was misheard pronunciation, and it clicked. SoundWave first came to the scene to deal with the problem of piracy in music. With their dedication, the small venture is now a streaming giant used in 61 countries with 159 million active users and a stunning 35 million song library.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Sticky Action -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-6 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#1C1C1E] via-[#1C1C1E] to-transparent pt-12 z-20\">\n                <button class=\"w-full bg-[#FFCF54] text-black font-medium text-base py-4 rounded-[20px] flex items-center justify-center relative\">\n                    Apply Now\n                    <div class=\"absolute right-2 top-2 bottom-2 w-10 bg-black/10 rounded-[14px] flex items-center justify-center\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-black text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- GSAP Script for Text Reveal -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", (event) => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            const revealElements = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-text');\n\n            revealElements.forEach((el) => {\n                // Manually split text into words while preserving line breaks if needed\n                let html = '';\n                const lines = el.innerHTML.split('<br>');\n\n                lines.forEach((line, index) => {\n                    const words = line.trim().split(' ');\n                    words.forEach((word) => {\n                        if (word) {\n                            html += `<span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom\"><span class=\"reveal-inner inline-block\">${word}</span></span> `;\n                        }\n                    });\n                    if (index < lines.length - 1) {\n                        html += '<br>';\n                    }\n                });\n\n                el.innerHTML = html;\n\n                // Animate the inner spans\n                gsap.fromTo(el.querySelectorAll('.reveal-inner'),\n                    { y: '100%' },\n                    {\n                        y: '0%',\n                        duration: 0.8,\n                        stagger: 0.05,\n                        ease: 'power3.out',\n                        scrollTrigger: {\n                            trigger: el,\n                            start: 'top 95%',\n                            toggleActions: 'play none none none'\n                        }\n                    }\n                );\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "mobile-job-app-flow.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/mobile-job-app-flow.jpg", "source_name": "mobile-job-app-flow-DESIGN.md", "views": 193, "forks": 10, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T23:35:20.372991+00:00"}